WEBVTT

00:00:28.494 --> 00:00:31.544
about my favorite subject
in all of biology:

00:00:32.235 --> 00:00:34.917
viruses and how they attack.

00:00:35.727 --> 00:00:38.055
And so I'm so excited
to discuss this with them,

00:00:38.079 --> 00:00:41.426
and I come in and I say,
"Can somebody please explain

00:00:41.450 --> 00:00:44.545
the main ideas and why this is so cool?"

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:46.987
There's silence.

00:00:49.352 --> 00:00:52.312
Finally, my favorite student,
she looks me straight in the eye,

00:00:52.336 --> 00:00:54.884
and she says, "The reading sucked."

00:00:55.257 --> 00:00:56.709
(Laughter)

00:00:57.525 --> 00:00:58.820
And then she clarified.

00:00:58.844 --> 00:01:01.343
She said, "You know what,
I don't mean that it sucks.